  "edition": "quran-uthmani",
  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 5932,
      "text": "By the sky and the night comer –",
      "surah": {
        "number": 86,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الطَّارِقِ",
        "englishName": "At-Taariq",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Morning Star",
        "numberOfAyahs": 17,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 1,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 591,
      "ruku": 528,
      "hizbQuarter": 236,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5933,
      "text": "and how do you know what the night comer is?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 86,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الطَّارِقِ",
        "englishName": "At-Taariq",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Morning Star",
        "numberOfAyahs": 17,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 2,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 591,
      "ruku": 528,
      "hizbQuarter": 236,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5934,
      "text": "It is the star of piercing brightness[1] –",
      "surah": {
        "number": 86,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الطَّارِقِ",
        "englishName": "At-Taariq",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Morning Star",
        "numberOfAyahs": 17,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 3,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 591,
      "ruku": 528,
      "hizbQuarter": 236,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5935,
      "text": "there is no soul except that there is a watcher over it.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 86,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الطَّارِقِ",
        "englishName": "At-Taariq",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Morning Star",
        "numberOfAyahs": 17,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 4,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 591,
      "ruku": 528,
      "hizbQuarter": 236,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5936,
      "text": "Let man reflect on what he was created from.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 86,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الطَّارِقِ",
        "englishName": "At-Taariq",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Morning Star",
        "numberOfAyahs": 17,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 5,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 591,
      "ruku": 528,
      "hizbQuarter": 236,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5937,
      "text": "He was created from a spurting fluid,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 86,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الطَّارِقِ",
        "englishName": "At-Taariq",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Morning Star",
        "numberOfAyahs": 17,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 6,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 591,
      "ruku": 528,
      "hizbQuarter": 236,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5938,
      "text": "emerging from between the backbone and the ribs[2].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 86,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الطَّارِقِ",
        "englishName": "At-Taariq",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Morning Star",
        "numberOfAyahs": 17,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 7,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 591,
      "ruku": 528,
      "hizbQuarter": 236,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5939,
      "text": "Indeed, Allah is able to bring him back to life.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 86,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الطَّارِقِ",
        "englishName": "At-Taariq",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Morning Star",
        "numberOfAyahs": 17,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 8,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 591,
      "ruku": 528,
      "hizbQuarter": 236,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5940,
      "text": "On the Day when all secrets will be disclosed[3],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 86,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الطَّارِقِ",
        "englishName": "At-Taariq",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Morning Star",
        "numberOfAyahs": 17,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 9,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 591,
      "ruku": 528,
      "hizbQuarter": 236,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5941,
      "text": "he will then have no power, nor any helper.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 86,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الطَّارِقِ",
        "englishName": "At-Taariq",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Morning Star",
        "numberOfAyahs": 17,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 10,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 591,
      "ruku": 528,
      "hizbQuarter": 236,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5942,
      "text": "By the sky and its recurring rain[4],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 86,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الطَّارِقِ",
        "englishName": "At-Taariq",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Morning Star",
        "numberOfAyahs": 17,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 11,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 591,
      "ruku": 528,
      "hizbQuarter": 236,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5943,
      "text": "and by the earth that cracks open [with the sprout of plants],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 86,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الطَّارِقِ",
        "englishName": "At-Taariq",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Morning Star",
        "numberOfAyahs": 17,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 12,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 591,
      "ruku": 528,
      "hizbQuarter": 236,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5944,
      "text": "Indeed, this [Qur’an] is a decisive word,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 86,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الطَّارِقِ",
        "englishName": "At-Taariq",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Morning Star",
        "numberOfAyahs": 17,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 13,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 591,
      "ruku": 528,
      "hizbQuarter": 236,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5945,
      "text": "which is not for amusement.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 86,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الطَّارِقِ",
        "englishName": "At-Taariq",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Morning Star",
        "numberOfAyahs": 17,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 14,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 591,
      "ruku": 528,
      "hizbQuarter": 236,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5946,
      "text": "Indeed, they are devising a plan.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 86,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الطَّارِقِ",
        "englishName": "At-Taariq",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Morning Star",
        "numberOfAyahs": 17,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 15,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 591,
      "ruku": 528,
      "hizbQuarter": 236,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5947,
      "text": "I am too devising a plan.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 86,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الطَّارِقِ",
        "englishName": "At-Taariq",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Morning Star",
        "numberOfAyahs": 17,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 16,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 591,
      "ruku": 528,
      "hizbQuarter": 236,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5948,
      "text": "So bear with the disbelievers, and give them respite for a while[5].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 86,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الطَّارِقِ",
        "englishName": "At-Taariq",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Morning Star",
        "numberOfAyahs": 17,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 17,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 591,
      "ruku": 528,
      "hizbQuarter": 236,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5949,
      "text": "Glorify the name of your Lord, the Most High,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 87,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَعۡلَىٰ",
        "englishName": "Al-A'laa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Most High",
        "numberOfAyahs": 19,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 1,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 591,
      "ruku": 529,
      "hizbQuarter": 237,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5950,
      "text": "Who created and fashioned in due proportion,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 87,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَعۡلَىٰ",
        "englishName": "Al-A'laa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Most High",
        "numberOfAyahs": 19,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 2,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 591,
      "ruku": 529,
      "hizbQuarter": 237,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5951,
      "text": "and Who determined [the creation] then inspired them,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 87,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَعۡلَىٰ",
        "englishName": "Al-A'laa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Most High",
        "numberOfAyahs": 19,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 3,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 591,
      "ruku": 529,
      "hizbQuarter": 237,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5952,
      "text": "and Who brings forth the pasture,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 87,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَعۡلَىٰ",
        "englishName": "Al-A'laa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Most High",
        "numberOfAyahs": 19,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 4,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 591,
      "ruku": 529,
      "hizbQuarter": 237,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5953,
      "text": "then makes it into withered chaff.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 87,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَعۡلَىٰ",
        "englishName": "Al-A'laa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Most High",
        "numberOfAyahs": 19,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 5,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 591,
      "ruku": 529,
      "hizbQuarter": 237,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5954,
      "text": "We will teach you [the Qur’an], so you will not forget,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 87,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَعۡلَىٰ",
        "englishName": "Al-A'laa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Most High",
        "numberOfAyahs": 19,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 6,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 591,
      "ruku": 529,
      "hizbQuarter": 237,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5955,
      "text": "except what Allah wills[1], for indeed He knows what is manifest and what is hidden.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 87,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَعۡلَىٰ",
        "englishName": "Al-A'laa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Most High",
        "numberOfAyahs": 19,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 7,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 591,
      "ruku": 529,
      "hizbQuarter": 237,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5956,
      "text": "We will guide you to the easy way[2].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 87,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَعۡلَىٰ",
        "englishName": "Al-A'laa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Most High",
        "numberOfAyahs": 19,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 8,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 591,
      "ruku": 529,
      "hizbQuarter": 237,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5957,
      "text": "So remind, if the reminder should benefit[3].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 87,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَعۡلَىٰ",
        "englishName": "Al-A'laa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Most High",
        "numberOfAyahs": 19,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 9,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 591,
      "ruku": 529,
      "hizbQuarter": 237,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5958,
      "text": "He who fears Allah will take heed,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 87,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَعۡلَىٰ",
        "englishName": "Al-A'laa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Most High",
        "numberOfAyahs": 19,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 10,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 591,
      "ruku": 529,
      "hizbQuarter": 237,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5959,
      "text": "but the wretched will avoid it,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 87,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَعۡلَىٰ",
        "englishName": "Al-A'laa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Most High",
        "numberOfAyahs": 19,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 11,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 591,
      "ruku": 529,
      "hizbQuarter": 237,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5960,
      "text": "who will enter the Great Fire,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 87,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَعۡلَىٰ",
        "englishName": "Al-A'laa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Most High",
        "numberOfAyahs": 19,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 12,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 591,
      "ruku": 529,
      "hizbQuarter": 237,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5961,
      "text": "wherein he will neither die nor live.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 87,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَعۡلَىٰ",
        "englishName": "Al-A'laa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Most High",
        "numberOfAyahs": 19,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 13,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 591,
      "ruku": 529,
      "hizbQuarter": 237,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5962,
      "text": "Indeed, he who purifies himself will attain success,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 87,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَعۡلَىٰ",
        "englishName": "Al-A'laa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Most High",
        "numberOfAyahs": 19,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 14,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 591,
      "ruku": 529,
      "hizbQuarter": 237,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5963,
      "text": "and remembers his Lord’s Name and prays.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 87,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَعۡلَىٰ",
        "englishName": "Al-A'laa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Most High",
        "numberOfAyahs": 19,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 15,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 591,
